Modifications in this distribution
----------------------------------

pypika-safe is a modified version of PyPika 0.51.1. The following files were
added or changed relative to upstream:

  ADDED    pypika/safety.py
           Dialect-aware literal escaping, LIKE pattern escaping, and identifier
           auditing helpers.

  ADDED    pypika/tests/test_safety.py
           Test suite for the safety layer (unit + real-database assertions).

  ADDED    tools/upstream_compare.py
           Behavioural comparison harness; runs against upstream or this fork.

  ADDED    tools/verify_mysql_literals.py
           MySQL literal round-trip verification via a MySQL grammar parser.

  ADDED    tools/verify_strict_engine.py
           Verification against a strict SQL engine (DuckDB).

  MODIFIED pypika/terms.py
           ValueWrapper renders string literals through escape_string_literal();
           bound parameters carry Python values instead of pre-rendered SQL;
           comparisons against a NULL literal emit IS [NOT] NULL; IN / NOT IN
           reject NULL members and empty lists; new LikeCriterion and
           Field.like_literal() / not_like_literal().

  MODIFIED pypika/queries.py
           QueryBuilder.BACKSLASH_ESCAPES knob, propagated through kwargs.

  MODIFIED pypika/__init__.py
           Re-exports of the new public API.

  MODIFIED setup.py, MANIFEST.in
           Distribution name pypika-safe; packaging metadata.

  MODIFIED pypika/tests/test_parameter.py
           Two assertions updated to match the corrected parameter behaviour
           (dates are now passed to the driver as datetime.date, not as a string).

All other files are unmodified from upstream PyPika 0.51.1.

